
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Registration | Official Form</title>

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    :root {
      --navy: #102b50;
      --blue: #2458a6;
      --gold: #e9bd72;
      --cream: #faf8f3;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --text: #24344b;
      --muted: #748198;
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background: var(--cream);
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    .hero {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #102344, #1e4c87 65%, #3479ad);
      color: white;
      padding: 24px 7% 95px;
    }

    .hero::before,
    .hero::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);
      border-radius: 50%;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .hero::before {
      width: 420px;
      height: 420px;
      right: -130px;
      top: -210px;
    }

    .hero::after {
      width: 300px;
      height: 300px;
      left: -170px;
      bottom: -190px;
    }

    nav {
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: auto;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .brand-icon {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);
      border-radius: 13px;
      color: var(--gold);
      font-size: 21px;
    }

    .nav-label {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #d7e5f7;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    .hero-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      max-width: 850px;
      margin: 76px auto 0;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 9px 16px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);
      border-radius: 50px;
      color: #f4d9a6;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.07);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1 {
      margin-top: 25px;
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: clamp(38px, 6vw, 65px);
      line-height: 1.12;
      letter-spacing: -1.5px;
    }

    h1 span {
      color: var(--gold);
    }

    .hero-content p {
      max-width: 560px;
      margin: 22px auto 0;
      color: #dbe5f3;
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .hero-button {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 30px;
      padding: 16px 27px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: var(--gold);
      color: #172a45;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.16);
      transition: transform .2s, background .2s;
    }

    .hero-button:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      background: #f5d49b;
    }

    .arrow {
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: -45px auto 0;
      padding: 0 22px 65px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .form-card {
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid #e9edf3;
      border-radius: 20px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(20,42,75,.10);
    }

    .card-header {
      padding: 30px 35px 25px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #edf0f5;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .card-header h2 {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 25px;
      color: var(--navy);
    }

    .card-header p {
      margin-top: 7px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .secure-tag {
      white-space: nowrap;
      color: #31724e;
      background: #edf8f0;
      padding: 9px 12px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .form-container {
      padding: 12px;
      background: #fff;
    }

    iframe {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 950px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: white;
    }

    .fallback {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px 15px 30px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .fallback a {
      color: var(--blue);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 25px 20px 35px;
      color: #8490a1;
      font-size: 12px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    footer span {
      color: var(--blue);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      .hero {
        padding: 20px 20px 80px;
      }

      .brand {
        font-size: 10px;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
      }

      .brand-icon {
        width: 36px;
        height: 36px;
      }

      .nav-label {
        font-size: 10px;
      }

      .hero-content {
        margin-top: 60px;
      }

      .hero-content p {
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      main {
        padding-left: 12px;
        padding-right: 12px;
      }

      .card-header {
        padding: 24px 20px;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }

      .card-header h2 {
        font-size: 22px;
      }

      .secure-tag {
        font-size: 9px;
        padding: 8px;
      }

      .form-container {
        padding: 5px;
      }

      iframe {
        min-height: 1050px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header class="hero">
    <nav>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="brand-icon">✦</div>
        <span>Official Registration</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nav-label">YOUR NEXT STEP STARTS HERE</div>
    </nav>

    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="eyebrow">You're invited</div>

      <h1>Make It Official.<br><span>Register Today.</span></h1>

      <p>
        We're glad you're here! Complete the registration form below
        to submit your information. It only takes a few minutes.
      </p>

      <a class="hero-button"
         href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeRL6-XfvxnerpPccpc8z6IitM5fRx2l8quHds02M1Oxo0WTw/viewform"
         target="_blank"
         rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Open Registration Form <span class="arrow">↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="form-card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <div>
          <h2>Registration Form</h2>
          <p>Please complete all required fields before submitting.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="secure-tag">✓ Google Forms</div>
      </div>

      <div class="form-container">
        <iframe
          src="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeRL6-XfvxnerpPccpc8z6IitM5fRx2l8quHds02M1Oxo0WTw/viewform?embedded=true"
          title="Registration Form"
          loading="lazy">
          Loading form...
        </iframe>
      </div>

      <div class="fallback">
        Having trouble viewing the form?
        <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeRL6-XfvxnerpPccpc8z6IitM5fRx2l8quHds02M1Oxo0WTw/viewform"
           target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Click here to open it directly.
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    Designed with care <span>✦</span><br>
    Please check your responses before submitting.
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
